
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# rv565:  file(1) magic for RV565 frame-independent RGB565 video
#
# RV565 is a container for microcontroller displays: a 12-byte little-endian
# header, then per frame a u32 length and a zlib stream that inflates to
# width*height big-endian RGB565 pixels.
# Specification: https://github.com/elixpo/rv565/blob/main/docs/FORMAT.md
# Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.35935
#
# The 3-byte magic is short, so also require version 6, a frame rate of
# 1-30, and a zlib header (0x78) on the first frame.
0	string		RV5
>3	byte		6
>>8	ubyte		>0
>>>8	ubyte		<31
>>>>16	ubyte		0x78		RV565 video
!:mime	video/x-rv565
!:ext	rv565
>>>>>4		uleshort	x		\b, %u
>>>>>6		uleshort	x		\bx%u
>>>>>8		ubyte		x		\b, %u fps
>>>>>10		uleshort	x		\b, %u frames
